# Godot
.godot/
bin/
*.import
*.uid
*.translation

# EXCEPTION (BLOCKER 2, 2026-09-12): these .import files carry non-default
# compress/mode=2 (VRAM Compressed) + compress/high_quality=true settings,
# individually PSNR-verified >=40dB against their Lossless originals
# (docs/artifacts/texture_compression_audit.md has the full per-file
# numbers). .import is normally never committed in this project (a fresh
# `--import` regenerates it with engine defaults) - committing exactly
# these means the compression choice survives a clean checkout instead of
# silently reverting to Lossless the next time anyone reimports. Nothing
# else under assets/textures/ is exempted.
!assets/textures/tiles/*.import
!assets/textures/surfaces/*.import
!assets/textures/environment/asphalt.png.import
!assets/textures/environment/brick.png.import
!assets/textures/environment/concrete.png.import

